@startuml notified-pull-overview
autonumber

title "Notified Pull, data availability (fire-and-forget)"
skinparam roundCorner 7
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderThickness .5

participant "Sender" as sender order 10
participant "Receiver" as receiver order 20

== Pre-coordination (once per partner) ==

sender -> sender : Register Subscription for Receiver

== Data made available + notification ==

sender -> sender : Create or update clinical resource\nor container (List / Composition / DocumentReference)
sender -> receiver ++: POST notification Bundle\n(focus references the resource or container,\noptional notification-authorization-hint)
receiver --> sender --: 200 OK

== Pull (whenever the Receiver decides) ==

note over receiver: time later, immediately,\nor never: the Sender does not require it

receiver -> sender ++: GET focus resource\n(presents notification-authorization-hint if provided)
sender --> receiver --: 200 OK + resource

opt If focus is a container, pull referenced entries
  loop entries
    receiver -> sender ++: GET entry
    sender --> receiver --: 200 OK + resource
  end
end

note over sender, receiver: Withdrawal is not announced separately.\nA later pull simply returns 410, 404, or 403.

@enduml
